                                                         "captions":  ".",
                                                         "transcript":  ".",
                                                         "description":  [
                                                                             "this is a song for a movie.",
                                                                             "the static artwork image was provided via Artstation \u0027link in Youtube description\u0027",
                                                                             "the brief was to make an original score under 90 seconds inspired by this image.",
                                                                             "i imagined that this told the story of two star-crossed lovers in a time where all human meetings are prescheduled and authorised / denied by a controlling system, and when the person on the bike gets conscripted for war, this is the last chance they get to meet, and possibly the last time they\u0027ll ever see each other.",
                                                                             "i then created some musical sketches, settling on one of a number of ideas i made for this, experimenting a lot with sound design. to finish it, i found a vocal sample that i felt gave it Dune-esque vibes.",
